    "attic.attic_bentwood_stand.story": "Her red umbrella still hangs on it.",
    "attic.attic_bookcase.story": "Her cookbooks — a few still have pressed flowers inside.",
    "attic.attic_marble_table.story": "Lida counted the till at it every morning — and always had a few coins left for the cat.",
    "attic.attic_piano_stool.story": "From the upright piano Lida sold in 1990 to pay the rent. She kept the stool.",
    "attic.attic_rag_rug.story": "Woven from old aprons — one stripe for every year of the café.",
    "attic.attic_reading_lamp.story": "Lida read every letter twice under this lamp.",
    "attic.attic_rubber_plant.story": "Lida watered it with cold coffee. She said it liked that.",
    "attic.attic_sewing_chair.story": "Lida darned the café's curtains in it — and then fell asleep in it.",
    "attic.attic_station_bench.story": "From the waiting room by platform two. Jindra sat on this bench the night he left.",
    "attic.attic_tram_lamp.story": "From the last Holešovice tram of 1998. Lida traded three bundt cakes for it.",
    "attic.attic_window_bench.story": "It stood under her kitchen window. Lida shelled peas on it and watched the trains.",
    "attic.toast.found": "The attic! The key to grandma's attic was behind her photo. A few flea-market pieces wait upstairs (Day → Attic).",
    "attic.toast.restocked": "Saturday: a few new old things turned up in the attic.",
    "backroom.toast.opened": "The back room is open again. The dust is gone, the tables wait for guests.",
