    "build.before_after.back_room": "the back room",
    "build.before_after.cozier": "a cosier café",
    "build_wish.barista_grinder.ask": "With a second grinder I'd always have it freshly ground. You'd smell the coffee on the platform.",
    "build_wish.barista_grinder.reason": "a second grinder",
    "build_wish.barista_grinder.thanks": "That sound! Freshly ground coffee — that's my music.",
    "build_wish.cook_rack.ask": "A dish rack by the sink would help. The plates are drying on the chairs.",
    "build_wish.cook_rack.reason": "a dish rack",
    "build_wish.cook_rack.thanks": "A dish rack. Small thing, big joy. Thanks!",
    "build_wish.crew_coats.ask": "Karolina, could we get a coat rack? Our jackets are hanging on the fridge.",
    "build_wish.crew_coats.reason": "a coat rack",
    "build_wish.crew_coats.thanks": "A coat rack! Finally my scarf isn't in the milk.",
    "build_wish.filip_socket.ask": "Sorry… is there a socket anywhere? My laptop is dying and the exam isn't.",
    "build_wish.filip_socket.reason": "a table with a socket",
    "build_wish.filip_socket.thanks": "A socket! At a table! This is the best café in town. Seriously.",
    "build_wish.hana_quiet.ask": "If there were one armchair with a lamp, somewhere to vanish for ten minutes…",
    "build_wish.hana_quiet.reason": "a quiet corner",
    "build_wish.hana_quiet.thanks": "An armchair. And a lamp. You really set it up for me… Thank you.",
    "build_wish.insomniacs_rug.ask": "At three in the morning the floor gets cold. A rug would fix it.",
    "build_wish.insomniacs_rug.reason": "a rug",
    "build_wish.insomniacs_rug.thanks": "A rug. Warm feet, quiet head. Maybe I'll even sleep tonight.",
    "build_wish.lori_stage.ask": "If there were a little space and a bit of light… I'd play for you. Just for a tea.",
    "build_wish.lori_stage.reason": "a little stage",
    "build_wish.lori_stage.thanks": "A stage… for me? Then I'll have to play better than ever.",
    "build_wish.mirek_radio.ask": "Lida used to keep a radio on the counter. It played softly all night. I miss it.",
    "build_wish.mirek_radio.reason": "the old radio",
    "build_wish.mirek_radio.thanks": "The radio! That's exactly how this place sounded when I was young.",
    "build_wish.nurses_sofa.ask": "After a twelve-hour shift I'd love to sink into something. A sofa, say.",
    "build_wish.nurses_sofa.reason": "a sofa",
    "build_wish.nurses_sofa.thanks": "A sofa… Five minutes. Just five and I'm human again.",
    "build_wish.radek_board.ask": "A departures board on the wall would help. People would ask less and drink more.",
    "build_wish.radek_board.reason": "a departures board",
    "build_wish.radek_board.thanks": "Board's up, trains are running. Order. That's how I like it.",
    "build_wish.students_sockets.ask": "Filip's table is full. Could there be another one with a socket?",
    "build_wish.students_sockets.reason": "more sockets",
    "build_wish.students_sockets.thanks": "Two sockets! Tonight we'll finish the whole term paper here.",
    "build_wish.vera_window.ask": "Lida always kept me a seat by the window. You can see the tracks from there.",
    "build_wish.vera_window.reason": "a seat by the window",
    "build_wish.vera_window.thanks": "A bench by the window… Just like in Lida's day. The crossword solves itself here.",
