    "ui.guest.preparing": "being prepared · ~{min} min",
    "ui.guest.regular": "regular",
    "ui.guest.talk": "Talk",
    "ui.guest.train": "train {time}",
    "ui.guest.unhappy": "Unhappy",
    "ui.guest.waiting": "waiting to be served",
    "ui.guest.wants": "waiting for: {item}",
    "ui.hands.brew_later": "That one can't be made just now — the order is still on the rail.",
    "ui.hands.practised": "{recipe} — practised. Quick brews of it come out better now.",
    "ui.hands.tip_float": "+{amount}",
    "ui.help.app.body": "The shift schedule (click to change the draft, Publish sends it out), swap and time-off requests, messages from @shiftella_bot, the board, checklists, the night digest and payroll.",
    "ui.help.app.title": "Shiftella ({key.app})",
    "ui.help.brewing.body": "The order card shows the wish and up to four recipes (1–4). Quick (Q) lets the machine do it; By hand plays a short mini-game for a better cup. U is the usual for a trusted regular, H hands a wish to a helper, {key.book} opens the recipe book. In a mini-game Space holds, arrows steer, Enter is done, Tab skips — a skipped cup is still a good cup. The night slows down while a card is open.",
    "ui.help.brewing.title": "Brewing",
    "ui.help.build.body": "Pick a piece and click in the café. R rotates, X demolishes, Ctrl+Z undoes, right-click or Esc cancels. Lamps, plants and rugs lift the mood.",
    "ui.help.build.title": "Build ({key.build})",
    "ui.help.crew.body": "Hire candidates, watch needs, skills and relationships. Letting someone go is one click — and Undo brings them back.",
    "ui.help.crew.title": "Crew ({key.crew})",
    "ui.help.duties.body": "Helpers only do what you give them: dishes, floor, register, bar, kitchen, serving. Each can carry one to three duties. Wishes, regulars and the little moments always stay yours.",
    "ui.help.duties.title": "Duties ({key.duties})",
    "ui.help.events.body": "News pops up bottom right; choices wait while paused and settle themselves after a while. The log ({key.log}), or a click on the line at the top, shows what happened.",
    "ui.help.events.title": "Events and the log",
    "ui.help.hands.body": "Karolina does the work herself. Click a guest to greet them and take the order; click a table to clear it, a coin to pick up the tip, the sink and hold to wash, swipe a dirt blot to mop it, the jukebox to change the record. Shift+click puts it first in her queue; right-click cancels what she's doing. Keyboard: Enter takes the ticket on the rail ([ ] move), {key.chore} does the nearest chore (hold {key.chore} at the sink), {key.greet} waves, Backspace cancels.",
    "ui.help.hands.title": "Behind the counter",
    "ui.help.minigames.body": "Every drink and dish plays like itself: milk froth, latte art, pour-over and turek, teas (chai with spices in a pan), plates, soups and mulled wine. Nothing can fail. The bar at the top right shows the stars you'd get now: ★ always, ★★ from 70 %, ★★★ from 90 %. A short guide shows the first time; \"?\" reopens it. Afterwards a line says what to try next time. A practised recipe (10 good plays) adds Lida's flourish — an extra bonus.",
    "ui.help.minigames.title": "Mini-games and stars",
    "ui.help.money.body": "Sales and tips come in at night; wages and supplies go out. Debt payments show in the day plan. A clean, quick, cosy café earns a better reputation.",
    "ui.help.money.title": "Money, debt, reputation",
    "ui.help.night.body": "{Key.pause} pauses, {key.speed1}/{key.speed2}/{key.speed3} set the speed, WASD and the wheel move the camera, Home shows the whole café. Hover a guest to see their wish; regulars sometimes want to talk.",
    "ui.help.night.title": "The night and the guests",
    "ui.help.priorities.body": "Rows are people, columns are jobs. 1 matters most, empty means never. Click raises, right-click or the wheel lowers.",
    "ui.help.priorities.title": "Priorities (P)",
    "ui.help.rhythm.body": "By day you plan (the clock stands still). At night, 22:00–06:00, the café runs. In the morning: a summary and an autosave. Enter starts the night.",
    "ui.help.rhythm.title": "Day and night",
    "ui.help.tip": "How to play ({key.help})",
    "ui.help.title": "How to play",
