    "walk.backstep.back": "Back inside",
    "walk.backstep.chip": "Step out back",
    "walk.backstep.chip_tip": "A breath of air on the back step (once a night). The café waits — nobody minds.",
    "walk.from.friend": "Terka",
    "walk.from.mum": "Mum",
    "walk.from.neighbour": "Mrs Marta",
    "walk.home": "Home.",
    "walk.line.bakery.1": "The bakery on the corner is just raising its shutter. Warm light, warm bread.",
    "walk.line.bakery.1.festive": "Gingerbread hearts in the window, and the baker humming a carol.",
    "walk.line.bakery.1.rain": "Rain drums on the bakery's awning. Inside it smells of sourdough and caraway.",
    "walk.line.bakery.2": "\"For your night owls,\" says the baker, wrapping a kolač in paper.",
    "walk.line.bakery.2.cold": "The paper bag keeps your cold hands warm all the way home.",
    "walk.line.embankment.1": "The Vltava is the colour of milky tea. A swan drifts past the moored boats.",
    "walk.line.embankment.1.fog": "Fog lies on the water. The far bank is just a row of lights.",
    "walk.line.embankment.1.rain": "Rain draws rings on the river. The boats knock softly against the pier.",
    "walk.line.embankment.1.snow": "Snow on the railings. Yours are the first footprints on the embankment.",
    "walk.line.embankment.2": "The sky over Letná turns peach. Somewhere a tram bell rings.",
    "walk.line.embankment.2.festive": "Lights on the boats, a little tree on someone's deck. The river celebrates too.",
    "walk.line.embankment.2.frost": "Frost on the benches. Your breath hangs in the air like a small cloud.",
    "walk.line.park.1": "Stromovka is still asleep. Only the blackbirds and a jogger in a yellow cap.",
    "walk.line.park.1.frost": "The grass is white with frost and crunches under your boots.",
    "walk.line.park.1.rain": "Wet leaves on the path, and a piece of sky in every puddle.",
    "walk.line.park.1.snow": "The park is white and quiet. A dog bounds through the snow, delighted.",
    "walk.line.park.2": "A bench by the pond, and a moment just to breathe.",
    "walk.line.park.2.fog": "The old trees step out of the fog one by one, like late guests.",
    "walk.line.tram.1": "The first tram glides out of the dawn, nearly empty and warmly lit.",
    "walk.line.tram.1.festive": "Someone has hung a tinsel star from the tram's handrail.",
    "walk.line.tram.1.rain": "Rain on the tram windows. You draw a little heart in the misted glass.",
    "walk.line.tram.1.snow": "The tram cuts two dark lines through the fresh snow.",
    "walk.line.tram.2": "A nurse after her night shift sits down beside you. You talk all the way to her stop.",
    "walk.msg.marta_geraniums": "I watered Lida's geraniums on the balcony. Still blooming, the stubborn things. Like you.",
    "walk.msg.marta_lida_dance": "Did you know your grandma once danced on that counter? New Year's Eve, '83. Don't tell your mother you heard it from me.",
    "walk.msg.marta_snow": "First snow on the station roof. Lida always said a night café is warmest when it snows.",
    "walk.msg.marta_soup": "I left a pot of soup by your door. Bring the pot back whenever, no hurry.",
    "walk.msg.marta_window": "I saw the light in Lida's window again tonight. I cried a little — the good kind.",
    "walk.msg.mum_christmas": "Christmas at ours, or shall we all come to the café? Your brother votes café.",
    "walk.msg.mum_dad": "Dad says hi. He wants to come and try the famous coffee. Be warned: he'll want three sugars.",
    "walk.msg.mum_eat": "Did you eat? A real meal, not a croissant at four in the morning.",
    "walk.msg.mum_first_week": "How's the first week? Grandma would be over the moon. And eat something that isn't cake.",
    "walk.msg.mum_sleep": "Text me when you're home. I know, I know. Text me anyway.",
    "walk.msg.mum_whatever_you_choose": "Whatever you decide about the café, we're proud of you. You don't have to carry it alone.",
    "walk.msg.terka_light": "Whatever happens next — you kept the light on. That counts for a lot.",
    "walk.msg.terka_meme": "Sending you a photo of a cat in a tiny raincoat. That's it. That's the message.",
    "walk.msg.terka_proud": "Walked past your café at midnight. It glows like a lantern. Proud of you, boss.",
    "walk.msg.terka_song": "A song on the radio sounds exactly like your café at 3 a.m. Sending it to you.",
    "walk.msg.terka_tired": "You sounded tired on the phone. Sleep tomorrow — I'll bring you soup and say nothing clever.",
    "walk.msg.terka_visit": "Saturday I'm coming with a book and staying till the trains. Save me the corner seat?",
    "walk.place": "Prague-Holešovice",
    "walk.route.bakery": "Bakery",
    "walk.route.bakery.hint": "Past the bakery that opens at six. A kolač for the counter: cozier for the first four hours.",
    "walk.route.bakery.tonight": "The kolač from the morning bakery waits on the counter. The café smells of butter and plum jam.",
    "walk.route.embankment": "Embankment",
    "walk.route.embankment.hint": "Along the Vltava. A clear head: your quick brews come out a touch better tonight.",
    "walk.route.embankment.tonight": "There's still a bit of the river in you — the quick brews come out steady tonight.",
    "walk.route.park": "Stromovka",
    "walk.route.park.hint": "Through the park. A calm hall for the first hours, guests a little more patient.",
    "walk.route.park.tonight": "You can still smell the wet grass of Stromovka. The hall starts the night calm.",
    "walk.route.tram": "Tram",
    "walk.route.tram.arrived": "The nurse from the tram is here — she waves from the door.",
    "walk.route.tram.hint": "The first tram. Someone you meet there drops by tonight.",
    "walk.route.tram.tonight": "The nurse from the morning tram said she might drop by. Keep a seat warm for her.",
    "walk.skip": "Skip",
    "walk.title": "Which way home?",
    "walk.usual": "as usual",
    "wish.bitter_mood": "Bitter. Like my mood. No sugar.",
    "wish.childhood": "Something from when I was a kid.",
    "wish.club_oven": "Something cold — the club was an oven.",
    "wish.earned_it": "Something sweet. I've earned it.",
    "wish.engaged": "We just got engaged! Something special!",
    "wish.exam_at_eight": "Fuel. I've got an exam at eight.",
    "wish.filip.cheapest": "The cheapest coffee that still counts as coffee?",
    "wish.filip.house_special": "That drink on your board — if it's not too pricey.",
    "wish.filip.passed": "I passed! Something fancy — my treat.",
    "wish.fog_outside": "Something warm. You can't see the station through this fog.",
    "wish.for_my_friend": "Something pretty — it's my friend's birthday.",
    "wish.goes_with_snow": "Something that goes with snow.",
    "wish.guest_333.two_sugars": "Tea. With lemon. Two sugars.",
    "wish.guest_anwar.oat": "An oat flat white, please. And maybe the Wi-Fi password.",
    "wish.hana.blanket": "Shift's over, Karolina. Something that feels like a blanket.",
    "wish.hana.house_special": "The one on the board. Before my phone goes again.",
    "wish.hana.twelve_minutes": "I've got twelve minutes. Something hot and fast.",
    "wish.hands_cold": "Anything warm to hold. My hands are frozen.",
    "wish.headache": "Something fresh, please. I've got a headache.",
    "wish.house_special": "The one on the board, please.",
    "wish.kind_coffee": "Wake me up gently — coffee, but kind.",
    "wish.like_grandma_made": "Something like my grandmother made? She was from Lviv.",
    "wish.long_day": "Something warm, not too sweet — long day.",
    "wish.lori.house_special": "The house drink everyone talks about. For the voice.",
    "wish.lori.my_voice": "Something for my voice. Honey, maybe?",
    "wish.lori.one_song": "One hot chocolate, paid in one song?",
    "wish.mirek.house_special": "Let me try that house drink of yours, Karolina.",
    "wish.mirek.like_lida": "Black, Karolina. The way Lida poured it.",
    "wish.mirek.tired_eyes": "Something for tired eyes, eh? Not that mine are tired.",
    "wish.mirek.walked": "I walked here tonight. Something to warm an old man.",
    "wish.not_coffee": "Anything but coffee. I've had six.",
    "wish.on_the_side": "Just a little something on the side.",
    "wish.one_hand": "Something I can drink with one hand — I'm flying a drone with the other.",
    "wish.patrol": "Strong, to go. Quiet night so far — let's keep it that way.",
    "wish.radek.house_special": "The house drink. I've earned it tonight.",
    "wish.radek.last_shift": "Last shift, Karolina. Make it a good one.",
    "wish.radek.no_rush": "No rush tonight. Something slow.",
    "wish.radek.to_go": "To go. The 01:12 won't dispatch itself.",
    "wish.skipped_dinner": "Something filling. I skipped dinner. And lunch.",
    "wish.sleepy_not_awake": "Something gentle. I'm trying to get sleepy, not awake.",
    "wish.slow_sip": "Something to sip slowly while the rain does its thing.",
    "wish.soaked": "Something with spice — I'm soaked to the bone.",
    "wish.surprise_me": "Surprise me. Something I'd never order.",
    "wish.taste_of_home": "Something that tastes like home. Anyone's home.",
    "wish.three_am": "It's three in the morning. I don't know what I want.",
    "wish.train_soon": "Whatever's fastest — my train's in ten minutes.",
    "wish.vera.house_special": "Show me what you came up with. Lida would want to know.",
    "wish.vera.lidas_kolac": "Your grandmother's koláč was better, Karolina. Show me yours.",
    "wish.vera.properly": "Tea. Properly made, mind you — no bag-dunking.",
    "wish.vera.she_would_make": "Make me something Lida would have made.",
    "wish.wake_me": "Something strong. I've still got four hours of driving.",
}
